\* INV-1: At the linearization point, the authorization was valid.
INV_1_AuthorizationSoundness ==
    phase = "SUBMITTING" => submitAuthValid

\* INV-2: At most one confirmed attempt per logical purchase.
INV_2_NoDoubleSubmit ==
    Cardinality({i \in submitted : providerStatus[i] = "confirmed"}) <= 1

\* INV-3: Single-use authorization.
\* This invariant is non-vacuous only in the extended model where
\* a Resume or ReAuthorize transition can return to AUTHORIZED.
