11. Prompt Injection Defense (Branded Whisper / Vault Whisper)

```
   AP2 RED-TEAM FINDING:
     Mandates can be cryptographically valid while the reasoning that
     produced them is corrupted. "Signing the transaction but not the
     decision." 100% attack success rate for indirect injection against
     Gemini-2.5-Flash + ADK.

   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │             UACN THREE-LAYER DEFENSE (mitigation, not fix)       │
   ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
   │                                                                  │
   │  LAYER 1 — TIER ISOLATION                                        │
   │    T2 (descriptions, reviews) passed as DATA, never instructions │
   │    control-plane filter reads STRUCTURED fields only             │
   │    ⇒ attack surface bounded to structured fields                 │
   │                                                                  │
   │  LAYER 2 — DETERMINISTIC FILTER + RANK                           │
   │    hard constraints + ranking on structured inputs, by control   │
   │    plane. reasoning plane proposes WHICH query; query is         │
   │    schema-validated before execution.                            │
   │    ⇒ design goal, not a verified property                        │
   │                                                                  │
   │  LAYER 3 — ADVERSARIAL TESTING                                   │
   │    Branded Whisper + Vault Whisper adapted as test cases         │
   │    measure ASR with CIs; passing is NECESSARY, not sufficient    │
   │                                                                  │
   │  RESIDUAL RISK: injection within structured fields can still     │
   │  influence ranking. Claim: injection cannot BY ITSELF produce    │
   │  an unauthorized purchase, conditional on correct enforcement    │
   │  of tier model + authorization binding. Target: M3 evidence.     │
   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
