   VACUITY CONTROL (counterexamples committed):
     CE-1  remove AuthValid guard from Submit    → falsifies INV-1
     CE-2  add Resume transition                 → falsifies INV-3
     CE-3  add ReAuthorize after CONFIRMED       → falsifies INV-2

